---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---
<figure class="architecture" aria-label="Conceptual Meridian finance workflow, based on the owner-reported MVP">
  <div class="diagram-heading"><span class="eyebrow">System overview</span><span class="diagram-symbol" aria-hidden="true">M<Arrow external /></span></div>
  <div class="flow-source"><span class="node-icon" aria-hidden="true">⇄</span><div><strong>Plaid Sandbox</strong><span>Test banking transactions</span></div><span class="mini-label">INPUT</span></div>
  <div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
  <div class="flow-core"><span class="eyebrow accent">Ingest & serve</span><strong>FastAPI backend</strong><span>Transaction data pipelines</span></div>
  <div class="flow-fork" aria-hidden="true"><span>↓</span><span>↓</span></div>
  <div class="flow-models"><div><span class="eyebrow">Classify</span><strong>XGBoost</strong><span>Spending categories</span></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Forecast</span><strong>Prophet</strong><span>Monthly spending</span></div></div>
  <div class="diagram-deployment"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> AWS ECS Fargate <span>Personal / beta</span></div>
  <figcaption>Conceptual workflow · owner-reported MVP.<br />Not a live system or a product screenshot.</figcaption>
</figure>
